  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Whenever I try to do emotes on steam deck in the new VRChat update (build 1201) I instinctively try to use R1 to change emotes for right hand and L1 for left hand instead of current configuration. Also selecting emote with R1 and joystick and then letting go with R1 obviously makes you suddenly move and to the direction your joystick was pointing, which is quite annoying - making the emote button a toggle could possibly make it better. Also the emote selection is quite inaccurate with it often selecting an emote next to the one you want or any random emote, especially when you let go of the joystick.",
